// Endurance Chart Key
// 1P: once per possession
// 1D: once per series of downs
// 2D: twice per series of downs
// 3D: three times per series of downs
// 4D: four times per series of downs
// N2: Not twice in a row
// N3: Not three times in a row
// N4: Not four times in a row
// N5: Not five times in a row
// N6: Not six times in a row

